# --- Source documents (raw/) ---
# Large PDFs (~40 MB) and publisher-copyright material. Kept local and OUT of
# version control so the repo stays lean and safe to publish (e.g. a website).
# raw/ is immutable source-of-truth you curate; back it up separately.
# To version sources in a PRIVATE repo instead, delete the next line.
raw/

# --- Obsidian per-machine state ---
# Workspace/graph/cache churn and are machine-specific. Delete this line if you
# want your Obsidian settings versioned with the vault.
.obsidian/

# --- macOS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
